      profile  Build with allocation tracking, run with perf (if available)
      doctor   Analyze .profile/ directory, print actionable optimization advice
      c-ffi    Generate portable CLEAR declarations from a C header
      fmt      Format CLEAR source files (see docs/agents/fmt.md)

    Build flags:
